    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests for {@link JulianChronology} and its associated {@link JulianDate}. <p> The proleptic Julian calendar differs from the ISO calendar only in its leap-year rule (every 4th year is leap, with no century exception). Many tests therefore pin down the offset between a Julian date and the equivalent ISO {@link LocalDate}."
   },
